# As Thick as Thieves (windurst 70): the tower qm2's naked test at its last slot (isNaked scans xi.slot.MAIN to BACK).
# Accepted by GM (a THF at level 50, the first forged envelope by GM); a Rabbit Mantle equipped on the back alone: the
